 "notes": [
  "Starting cards as posted under 'Starting (8)': Bring Him Before Me / Take Your Father's Place (posted 'BHBM'), Death Star II: Throne Room, Insignificant Rebellion, Your Destiny, Prepared Defenses, Imperial Arrest Order, Mobilization Points and Battle Order; these count toward the 60 (total 60 as published). Several Effects start, so no single starting Effect is set. Secret Plans is the older Effect (not a Defensive Shield).",
  "The post says the original idea came from Travis Dessel and was tweaked by Mike; credited to Mike as posted.",
  "Posted 'DII Throne Room' dested Death Star II: Throne Room; 'DII DB' Death Star II: Docking Bay; 'Endor Landing Platform' Endor: Landing Platform (Docking Bay); 'IAO' Imperial Arrest Order.",
  "Posted 'DV, DLOTS' dested Darth Vader, Dark Lord Of The Sith; 'Mara Jade' Mara Jade, The Emperor's Hand; 'Admiral Chiraneu' Admiral Chiraneau; 'Dr. E' Dr. Evazan (the strategy pairs him with Mara against Profit); 'Iggy w/Riot Gun' IG-88 With Riot Gun.",
  "Posted 'Flagship Executer' dested Flagship Executor; 'Vader's Saber' Vader's Lightsaber; 'Mara's Saber' Mara Jade's Lightsaber; Sense and Alter are the Dark Premiere interrupts. Duplicates of unique cards kept as posted (2 Lord Vader, 2 Darth Vader, Dark Lord Of The Sith)."
